@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
autonumber
skinparam linetype ortho
participant Tester
participant ECU
participant KMS

Tester -> ECU: Try to establish diagnostic session
ECU -> Tester: Generate unique challenge (nonce + auth bits)
Tester -> KMS: Pass challenge
KMS -> KMS: Check user authorization
alt Authorized
    KMS -> Tester: Sign challenge with RSASSA-PSS
else Not Authorized
    KMS -> Tester: Authorization failed
end
Tester -> ECU: Give KMS response
ECU -> ECU: Verify signature
alt Signature correct
    ECU -> Tester: Access granted
else Signature incorrect
    ECU -> Tester: Access denied
end
@enduml